    def test_seeded_metastable_decays_exponentially_on_the_wall():
        """A seeded Ar* in a neutral argon deck (no charged population, no chemistry)
        decays as exp(-nu_m t) through the production integrator, and ground Ar gains
        exactly what Ar* loses. Ar* -> Ar leaves the neutral total unchanged, so nu_m is
        constant along the trajectory and the exponential is exact."""
